---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Meet the Burnham Nationwide Team" description="Meet Burnham Nationwide’s permit managers, code consultants and operations professionals supporting construction projects across the US." nav="about">
  <div class="page-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>About</li><li>Team</li></ol>
      <nav aria-label="About Burnham"><a href="/about/why-burnham/">Why Burnham</a><a href="/about/team/" aria-current="page">Team</a><a href="/about/history/">History</a><a href="/about/testimonials/">Testimonials</a><a href="/about/careers/">Careers</a><a href="/diversity-inclusion/">Diversity</a><a href="/about/faq/">FAQ</a></nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-hero page-hero--plain">
    <div class="wrap stack section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div>
      <h1 class="h-display">Meet our nationwide team.</h1>
      <p class="lede">For more than three decades, Burnham’s permit managers, code consultants and the operations team behind them have made sure projects get done right the first time. Everything the team does is personal.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--flush-top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="team-group stack stack--lg">
        <h2 class="h-section" style="font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 34px);">Leadership &amp; operations</h2>
        <div class="grid grid--4">
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/chris-downes.jpg" alt="Portrait of Chris Downes" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Chris Downes</span>
            <span class="person__role">President</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Municipal approvals can be complex &amp; frustrating if you don&#x27;t do this every day. I enjoy the coordination process and managing expectations.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/kristina-papryzca.jpg" alt="Portrait of Kristina Papryzca" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Kristina Papryzca</span>
            <span class="person__role">President, Chicago Division</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Specializing in complex development projects, skyscrapers and bespoke tenant improvements.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/matt-murray.jpg" alt="Portrait of Matt Murray" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Matt Murray</span>
            <span class="person__role">President, Nationwide Division</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Large/complex rollout projects are my specialty thanks to two decades of working with nearly every sector and jurisdiction.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/tom-walsh.jpg" alt="Portrait of Tom Walsh" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Tom Walsh</span>
            <span class="person__role">President, New York Division</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“It’s interesting to pick up on retail trends, and I bring those best practices I learn to every project I work on.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/matt-elwell.jpg" alt="Portrait of Matt Elwell, CPTD" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Matt Elwell, CPTD</span>
            <span class="person__role">Chief of Staff</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Our people support a better-built world, and I have the honor of supporting them.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/steve-rodriguez.jpg" alt="Portrait of Steve O. Rodriguez" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Steve O. Rodriguez</span>
            <span class="person__role">Director of Field Operations</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“In the 19 plus years I have been at Burnham I can say no two job sites are the same and that&#x27;s a great thing!”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/louie-greenebaum.jpg" alt="Portrait of Louie Greenebaum" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Louie Greenebaum</span>
            <span class="person__role">Director of Signs &amp; Licensing</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Licensing, Signage and anything bespoke that you want to do in Chicago is what I do best. I help your business thrive and grow.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/peggy-kienzle.jpg" alt="Portrait of Peggy Kienzle" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Peggy Kienzle</span>
            <span class="person__role">Office Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Keeping Burnham&#x27;s HQ Office running smoothly, supporting accounting, our staff culture &amp; events makes everyday fulfilling and interesting.”</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="team-group stack stack--lg">
        <h2 class="h-section" style="font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 34px);">Code consulting</h2>
        <div class="grid grid--4">
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/christopher-chwedyk.jpg" alt="Portrait of Christopher Chwedyk" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Christopher Chwedyk</span>
            <span class="person__role">Director / Chief Code Consultant</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“As a licensed architect &amp; building code expert I&#x27;ve assisted design teams on a variety of projects across the country!”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/leah-riley.jpg" alt="Portrait of Leah Riley" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Leah Riley</span>
            <span class="person__role">Managing Senior Code Consultant</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“With people in mind, I work to find creative solutions to align the current codes with both modern and historic architecture.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/john-kapecki.jpg" alt="Portrait of John Kapecki" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">John Kapecki</span>
            <span class="person__role">Code Consultant</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“I perform due diligence inspections, standards &amp; tests presentations, life safety evaluations, and building/zoning code reviews.”</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="team-group stack stack--lg">
        <h2 class="h-section" style="font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 34px);">Project management</h2>
        <div class="grid grid--4">
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/tracy-willie.jpg" alt="Portrait of Tracy Willie" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Tracy Willie</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Executive</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“With more than three decades of experience in the architectural sector and having been a client of Burnham myself, I possess the ability to view each project from dual perspectives.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/mary-thies.jpg" alt="Portrait of Mary Thies" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Mary Thies</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Executive</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“I enjoy helping a variety of design professionals, contractors and property owners alleviate stress from their role, knowing that we will get it done and get it done right.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/jessica-sulka.jpg" alt="Portrait of Jessica Sulka" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Jessica Sulka</span>
            <span class="person__role">Senior Project Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“I enjoy working with the varying construction professionals to find the most strategic and quickest way of securing a permit.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/james-kratochvil.jpg" alt="Portrait of James Kratochvil" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">James Kratochvil</span>
            <span class="person__role">Senior Project Manager</span>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/maeve-odonovan.jpg" alt="Portrait of Maeve O&#x27;Donovan" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Maeve O&#x27;Donovan</span>
            <span class="person__role">Senior Project Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Guiding clients through their projects and seeing them come to life in our city is incredibly rewarding.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/jessica-madrigal.jpg" alt="Portrait of Jessica Madrigal" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Jessica Madrigal</span>
            <span class="person__role">Senior Project Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“With extensive experience working with engineers, architects, and navigating various jurisdictions, we specialize in obtaining building permits for diverse projects.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/brad-durkin.jpg" alt="Portrait of Brad Durkin" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Brad Durkin</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“I help my clients successfully navigate the commercial plan review process from start to finish.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/tasia-kallies.jpg" alt="Portrait of Tasia Kallies" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Tasia Kallies</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Working with design, engineering &amp; construction teams to find the fastest way to a permit is a fulfilling challenge!”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/kevin-mckenna.jpg" alt="Portrait of Kevin McKenna" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Kevin McKenna</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“I provide the unique opportunity of becoming an expert on interpreting codes and permitting requirements across the country.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/greg-francisco.jpg" alt="Portrait of Greg Francisco" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Greg Francisco</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“Growing up in the city, it&#x27;s being a part of ideas and projects that help make the place a better place than it was before.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/larry-downes.jpg" alt="Portrait of Larry Downes Jr." loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Larry Downes Jr.</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/colin-jaehnke.jpg" alt="Portrait of Colin Jaehnke" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Colin Jaehnke</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
            <p class="person__quote">“I assist clients in navigating the permitting process for a wide range of projects across California, ensuring efficiency, compliance, and a seamless experience.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/austin-vanderwouden.jpg" alt="Portrait of Austin VanDerWouden" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Austin VanDerWouden</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/casey-reilly.jpg" alt="Portrait of Casey Reilly" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Casey Reilly</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/jacqueline-partida-flores.jpg" alt="Portrait of Jacqueline Partida Flores" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Jacqueline Partida Flores</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/gaby-guzman.jpg" alt="Portrait of Gaby Guzman" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Gaby Guzman</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
          </div>
          <div class="person">
            <img src="/assets/img/about/team/hetiene-rudolpho.jpg" alt="Portrait of Hetiene Rudolpho" loading="lazy">
            <span class="person__name">Hetiene Rudolpho</span>
            <span class="person__role">Project Manager</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Vision &amp; mission</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">A special experience for every client and every project, every time.</h2>
        <p class="lede">The team cares for people and their roles, supports one another effectively and efficiently, and grows by creating new and better processes and learning from experience.</p>
        <div><a class="link" href="/about/why-burnham/">Our values</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/img/about/team-care.jpg" alt="Burnham team members at the ACE Mentor Program Chicago event holding an Amazing Summer Experiences Ahead sign" width="1600" height="1357" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap cta-block">
      <div class="stack stack--sm">
        <h2>Work with this team.</h2>
        <p>A project manager in the office nearest your site will map the path to approval.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Start a project</a>
        <a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="/about/careers/">Join the team</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
